	(text "Camera: 24-pin ESP32-CAM style FPC (J12), 8-bit DVP to U13. DOVDD from VSENS-3V3; AVDD 2.8 V and DVDD 1.2 V\nfrom ME6211 LDOs. CAM-RESET from U28 PB9 (R244 holds it in reset), CAM-PWDN from U13 PC10.\nFirmware: XCLK, SCCB, PWDN and RESET low or hi-Z while VSENS-3V3 is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.934 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1f061ac4-6fea-4324-a770-40ae87596c49")
	)
	(text "The watchdog shuts off motors when not petted.\nDebugging, BOOT0 and flashing do NOT disable the watchdog,\nso they stop the motors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "684d6a7d-c5ed-4b75-b45d-a544822f7292")
	)
	(text "J4: UART console, reached from\nthe top under a cover\n\nJ4 1-6: USB-serial cable (TTL-234X-3V3):\n1 GND, 4 TXD -> MCU-RX, 5 RXD <- MCU-TX;\n2 CTS#, 3 VCC, 6 RTS# not connected.\nJ4 7 SWDIO, 8 SWCLK, 9 NRST (+ GND on 1):\nWCH-LinkE for U13.\n\nAll debug, spare headers are VERTICAL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.766 134.112 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e37740c-9b46-4fe7-bea5-515dde47faca")
	)
	(text "Short BOOT0 to VMCU-3V3 to load firmware via USB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.52 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b714eb57-1750-4647-858e-52b8124022c9")
	)
	(text "Carpet echo: OPA3 non-inverting AC amplifier (out PE7 = OPA3_OUT1, in- PB2, in+ PB13),\nthen an envelope detector into PA1 (ADC). Gain 11, set on the bench.\nD48 rectifier with a 56 µs hold feeds the ADC, so the ADC can run slowly.\nA 1M pull-down on PB2 keeps the bootloader working, since that pin doubles as a boot pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 123.952 121.666 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8975a64-0a25-45f0-848d-54cc54708e16")
	)
	(text "J13 (not fitted): every spare MCU pin that is not on J1, so J1 keeps its size.\n2x3: 1 SPARE-PA15 (U13), 2 MCU2-PC14, 3 MCU2-PC15 (U28; weak pins, sink only ~3 mA),\n4 MCU2-NRST (U28 reset, also driven by U13 PC13), 5 and 6 GND. Put future spares here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 189.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ed3c0b4f-f86e-4e8a-91cf-c0f704440967")
	)
	(text "U28 CH32L103: link to U13 on USART2 (PA2/PA3),\nalso its bootloader port: U13 sets MCU2-BOOT\n(BOOT0) high and pulses MCU2-NRST to flash it.\nPA13/PA14 (SWDIO/SWCLK) free for a WCH-LinkE.\nBoard temperature: the U28 and U13 internal sensors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 272.542 130.048 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f9de9a77-50e6-4a14-b8e0-722069309940")
	)
